1169
01:23:11,856 --> 01:23:12,944
Abby...

1170
01:23:14,511 --> 01:23:15,729
Bicaralah padaku.

1171
01:23:23,215 --> 01:23:24,347
Aku membunuh ibuku.

1172
01:23:27,045 --> 01:23:28,090
Ibuku tersayang.

1173
01:23:29,395 --> 01:23:30,483
Apa?

1174
01:23:32,877 --> 01:23:34,487
Dulu saat aku masih kecil...

1175
01:23:35,488 --> 01:23:37,448
dia berdoa di samping tempat tidurku
setiap malam.

1176
01:23:38,317 --> 01:23:39,536
Setiap malam tanpa putus.

1177
01:23:42,843 --> 01:23:45,498
Dan saat dia sakit parah,

1178
01:23:45,542 --> 01:23:48,501
dia memintaku berdoa bersamanya
setiap malam.

1179
01:23:50,982 --> 01:23:53,419
Dan kukatakan aku tak bisa
karena aku terlalu sibuk.

1180
01:23:54,420 --> 01:23:55,508
Lelah.

1181
01:23:56,988 --> 01:23:58,250
Tapi itu tidak benar.

1182
01:24:00,861 --> 01:24:02,515
Dia berhenti makan,

1183
01:24:04,039 --> 01:24:05,605
dan dia berhenti bicara.

1184
01:24:07,738 --> 01:24:09,000
Semuanya sudah terlambat.

1185
01:24:12,438 --> 01:24:13,787
Aku membunuh ibuku.

1186
01:24:18,575 --> 01:24:20,055
Kau orang baik, Abby.

1187
01:24:21,926 --> 01:24:23,101
Kau orang baik.

1188
01:24:24,276 --> 01:24:25,582
Bagaimana kau tahu?

1189
01:24:27,105 --> 01:24:28,454
Karena aku meyakininya.

1190
01:24:30,674 --> 01:24:32,502
Aku meyakininya, Abby.

1191
01:24:39,683 --> 01:24:40,727
Abby?

1192
01:24:48,039 --> 01:24:49,345
Sudah terlambat.

1193
01:24:51,434 --> 01:24:54,480
Ya Tuhan! Sialan!

1194
01:24:54,524 --> 01:24:56,091
Lacak teleponnya, Justin!

1195
01:24:56,134 --> 01:24:57,918
Ya Tuhan! Sialan!
Ya Tuhan!

1196
01:24:57,962 --> 01:24:59,082
Di mana ponselku? Di mana...

1197
01:25:00,486 --> 01:25:01,922
Aku tidak... aku...

1198
01:25:03,446 --> 01:25:05,709
Astaga!

1199
01:25:05,752 --> 01:25:08,146
Evy, aku... Halo?

1200
01:25:08,190 --> 01:25:09,582
Evy, kau bisa mendengarku?

1201
01:25:09,626 --> 01:25:11,149
Evy? Halo?

1202
01:25:12,716 --> 01:25:14,805
Tunggu, Evy, aku tidak... aku...

1203
01:25:14,848 --> 01:25:16,763
Aku tak bisa mendengarmu.
Aku tak... Halo?

1204
01:25:16,807 --> 01:25:18,809
Halo?

1205
01:25:18,852 --> 01:25:20,245
Evy, kau di mana?

1206
01:25:20,289 --> 01:25:21,464
Ya Tuhan!

1207
01:25:23,857 --> 01:25:24,902
Evy!

1208
01:25:26,033 --> 01:25:27,078
Evy!

1209
01:25:37,784 --> 01:25:39,304
Aku ingin dengar
Baa, Baa, Black Sheep.

1210
01:26:14,821 --> 01:26:16,823
Keluar dari rumah itu.

1211
01:26:18,782 --> 01:26:20,412
- Aku membunuh ibuku.
- Keluar dari rumah itu!

1212
01:26:20,436 --> 01:26:22,307
Aku ingin bicara dengan Mary.

1213
01:26:22,351 --> 01:26:23,980
- Keluar dari rumah itu!
- Aku membunuh ibuku.

1214
01:26:24,004 --> 01:26:24,831
Aku ingin bicara dengan Mary.

1215
01:26:24,875 --> 01:26:25,919
Aku membunuh ibuku.

1216
01:26:25,963 --> 01:26:27,356
Ibu mendoakanmu.

1217
01:26:27,399 --> 01:26:28,879
Ibuku tersayang.

1218
01:26:28,922 --> 01:26:31,360
Suara itu mengejekku.

1219
01:26:54,078 --> 01:26:56,994
Dengar... Kau mendengar sesuatu?

1220
01:27:13,445 --> 01:27:15,055
Gadis kecilmu sedang hamil.

1221
01:27:16,013 --> 01:27:18,624
Aku ingin menamainya Mary.

1222
01:27:18,668 --> 01:27:21,410
Ingat saat Mama selalu mendoakan
"Salam Maria" untukku?

1223
01:27:21,453 --> 01:27:23,020
Setiap malam.

1224
01:27:25,065 --> 01:27:27,894
Hanya saja sepertinya aku tak layak
menjadi seorang ibu...

1225
01:27:33,509 --> 01:27:34,640
Justin!

1226
01:27:39,515 --> 01:27:41,430
Justin!

1227
01:27:43,432 --> 01:27:45,303
Evy, Evy!
Aku di sini. Aku di sini.

1228
01:27:46,478 --> 01:27:47,827
Suara apa ini?

1229
01:27:47,871 --> 01:27:51,962
Uozyba-ni-emoc.

1230
01:27:52,005 --> 01:27:54,225
- Uozyba-ni-emoc.
- Suara sialan apa ini?

1231
01:27:54,269 --> 01:27:55,835
Aku akan menolongmu.

1232
01:27:55,879 --> 01:27:57,184
Aku akan... aku akan menolongmu.

1233
01:27:57,228 --> 01:27:58,925
Jangan! Jangan tinggalkan aku!

1234
01:27:58,969 --> 01:28:00,512
Aku tak tahu harus apa.
Aku tak bisa bantu.

1235
01:28:00,536 --> 01:28:13,331
Uozyba-ni-emoc!

1236
01:29:47,164 --> 01:29:48,992
Mama!

1237
01:29:57,261 --> 01:29:58,610
Mama!

1238
01:29:59,698 --> 01:30:01,961
Mama!

1239
01:30:02,005 --> 01:30:04,486
Tidak! Tidak! Tidak!

1240
01:30:04,529 --> 01:30:10,143
Mama!

1241
01:30:11,841 --> 01:30:17,194
Justin!

1242
01:30:27,334 --> 01:30:28,945
Ada yang salah, Justin.

1243
01:30:30,381 --> 01:30:32,035
Aku kedinginan sekali.

1244
01:30:35,212 --> 01:30:42,741
Uozyba-ni-emoc.

1245
01:30:43,786 --> 01:30:45,309
Uozyba-ni-emoc.

1246
01:30:46,963 --> 01:30:51,489
Uozyba-ni-emoc.

1247
01:30:52,621 --> 01:30:54,449
Uozyba-ni-emoc.

1248
01:30:56,015 --> 01:30:57,234
Masuklah, Abyzou.

